	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0501_oldman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さきんずれば　ひとを　せいす▼
ひとよりも　さきに　こうどうすれば
ゆうりな　たちばに　たてる▽
という　ことわざ　じゃよ！▼
これを　ポケモンに　もたせれば
ことわざの　いみも　わかるだろう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T09:35:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T09:28:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>先んずれば　人を制す▼
人よりも　先に　行動すれば
有利な　立場に　立てる▽
という　ことわざ　じゃよ！▼
これを　ポケモンに　持たせれば
ことわざの　意味も　わかるだろう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T09:35:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T09:28:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アイテム入手処理
　No217「せんせいのツメ」
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T09:28:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0501_oldman_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せんせいのツメ▼
それを　もっている　ポケモンは
ときどき　あいてより▽
はやく　わざが　だせるように　なる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T09:38:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T09:28:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>せんせいのツメ▼
それを　持っている　ポケモンは
ときどき　相手より▽
速く　技が　だせるように　なる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T09:38:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T09:28:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アイテム入手後
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T09:28:36" />
		</CommentCell>
